message: "If you use this learning module, please cite it as below."
title: "Hands-on VNA: an open learning module on vector network analysis and calibration with a low-cost NanoVNA"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Miguel-Medina"
    given-names: "Telmo"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0004-0654-6650"
repository-code: "https://github.com/telmomm/nanovna-measurement-course"
license:
