version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-26
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23669895
url: "https://telmomm.github.io/nanovna-measurement-course/"
abstract: >-
  Open, bilingual (English and Spanish) computational learning module on
  S-parameter measurement and calibration. In five Jupyter notebooks students
  derive the three-term error model of a vector network analyzer, implement
  short-open-load calibration, verify it on a synthetic instrument and apply it
  to real NanoVNA measurements included in the repository. It includes worked
  solutions, an instructor guide, an assessment rubric, web and PDF books, and
  automated technical validation. No hardware is required.
keywords:
  - vector network analyzer
  - NanoVNA
  - S-parameters
  - calibration
  - Smith chart
  - Jupyter
  - open educational resources
  - engineering education
